01:40:55.400 --> 01:40:59.970
and GABA activity in the
anterior cingulate cortex,

01:40:59.970 --> 01:41:02.283
which fits with turning down activity.

01:41:03.220 --> 01:41:05.050
To the extent that we can self-medicate

01:41:05.050 --> 01:41:07.510
