01:41:07.510 --> 01:41:10.500
what benzodiazepines do to the brain,

01:41:10.500 --> 01:41:13.020
that can happen when
people are hypnotized.

01:41:13.020 --> 01:41:15.500
- So you're saying inside of the hypnosis,

01:41:15.500 --> 01:41:17.370
you have neural evidence that,

01:41:17.370 --> 01:41:20.820
there's a kind of a
sedative effect of hypnosis

01:41:20.820 --> 01:41:22.040
at the chemical level.

01:41:22.040 --> 01:41:23.030
- Yeah, right.
- Amazing.

01:41:23.030 --> 01:41:24.700
- The people who are more hypnotizable,

01:41:24.700 --> 01:41:26.590
